### Try the API from VS Code (install the "REST Client" extension, then click "Send Request").
### Start the server first:  npm start       Replace the values in {{ }} and <...> with your own.

@base = http://127.0.0.1:3000

### Is the server alive?
GET {{base}}/api/health

### Who am I? (no cookie yet, so "user": null)
GET {{base}}/api/session

### Sign in. REST Client keeps the cookie for you.
# @name login
POST {{base}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: bitwixt

{ "email": "you@example.com", "password": "<your password>" }

### Who am I now?
GET {{base}}/api/session

### Which AI services are ready?
GET {{base}}/api/ai/providers

### Ask the AI (non-streaming)
POST {{base}}/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
X-Requested-With: bitwixt

{ "prompt": "Write one friendly sentence welcoming a new client.", "stream": false }
